  "question": {
    "text": "The number of distinct real roots of the equation, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> in the interval <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math> is :"
  },
